# Node Visualization Diagnostic Report

## Symptoms Reported
1. **Sometimes shows nothing** — node boxes are empty
2. **Shows OD instead of Spot** — lifecycle classification is wrong
3. **Shows different number of nodes** — node count is inconsistent

---

## Architecture: Data Flow

```mermaid
graph LR
    A[AWS EC2<br/>describe_instances] --> B[Discovery Worker<br/>discovery.py]
    B --> C[(instances table<br/>lifecycle column)]
    D[Agent DaemonSet<br/>pod_metrics_collector.py] --> E[worker_routes.py<br/>register-node / heartbeat]
    E --> C
    C --> F[cluster_service.py<br/>get_cluster_nodes_detailed]
    F --> G[cluster_routes.py<br/>GET /nodes/detailed]
    G --> H[ClusterList.jsx<br/>NodeTreemap component]

    I[AWS EC2<br/>analyze_cluster_potential] --> J[(clusters table<br/>spot_count column)]
    J --> K[cluster_service.py<br/>list_clusters]
    K --> H
```

